globalThis.IQLocalePacks=globalThis.IQLocalePacks||{};globalThis.IQLocalePacks.ha={"code":"ha","messages":{"Estimated median range":"Kimanta matsakaicin zango","Public comparisons include all contributors using this puzzle version. Optional age group and country are only used in private aggregate statistics.":"Kwatantawa ta jama'a ta haɗa da duk masu ba da gudummawa da ke amfani da wannan sigar wasanin gwada ilimi. Ana amfani da rukunin shekaru da ƙasa na zaɓi kawai a cikin ƙididdigar jimillar masu zaman kansu.","I agree to contribute my anonymous question results, active times and any optional age group or country to aggregate statistics.":"Na yarda in ba da gudummawar sakamakon tambayoyina marasa suna, lokutan aiki da kowace ƙungiyar shekaru ko ƙasa ta zaɓi don tattara ƙididdiga.","Median ranges are estimated from time histograms. The displayed interval shows the timing resolution; no exact median or speed percentile is claimed.":"Ana ƙiyasta matsakaicin zango daga tarihin lokaci. Tazarar da aka nuna tana nuna ƙudurin lokaci; babu takamaiman kashi na matsakaici ko saurin da aka yi iƙirari.","Share the challenge":"Raba ƙalubalen","Question time":"Lokacin tambaya","Your browser privacy preferences keep these statistics on your device.":"Zaɓin sirrin mai bincikenka yana ajiye waɗannan ƙididdiga akan na'urarka.","All voluntary attempts":"Duk ƙoƙarin son rai","Thank you. Your anonymous contribution was saved.":"Na gode. An adana gudummawarka mara suna.","There are not enough comparable attempts in this group yet. Your own statistics are always available.":"Babu isassun yunƙurin kama da juna a cikin wannan rukunin tukuna. Ƙididdigar ku koyaushe suna samuwa.","Comparisons are temporarily unavailable. Your own statistics and sharing still work.":"Ba a samun kwatancen na ɗan lokaci ba. Ƙididdigar ku da rabawa har yanzu suna aiki.","This older attempt has no complete timing record. You can still explore and share your result.":"Wannan tsohon yunƙurin ba shi da cikakken rikodin lokaci. Har yanzu kuna iya bincika da raba sakamakon ku.","Choose whether to contribute before sending any data.":"Zaɓi ko za ku bayar da gudummawa kafin aika wani bayani.","This attempt has no complete timing record. Your personal results are unchanged.":"Wannan yunƙurin ba shi da cikakken rikodin lokaci. Sakamakon ku na sirri ba ya canzawa.","Your contribution could not be saved in this browser. Nothing was sent.":"Ba za a iya adana gudummawar ku a cikin wannan burauzar ba. Ba a aika komai ba.","This contribution needs review and was not counted again.":"Wannan gudummawar tana buƙatar bita kuma ba a sake ƙidaya ta ba.","Your contribution has not been confirmed. Try again with the same saved contribution.":"Ba a tabbatar da gudummawar ku ba. Gwada sake da wannan gudummawar da aka adana.","No account needed":"Ba a buƙatar asusu","The test starts when you are ready":"Jarrabawar za ta fara ne da zarar ka shirya","Test":"Jarrabawa","Answered questions":"Tambayoyin da aka amsa","Something to share":"Abin da za a iya rabawa","Your strongest moment":"Lokacin da ka fi nuna ƙwarewa","Your estimated IQ":"Ƙiyasin matakin basirarka (IQ)","A tricky puzzle, solved quickly":"Tambaya mai wuyar fahimta, wadda aka warware cikin sauri","Quicker than the typical correct answer":"Da sauri fiye da yadda ake ɗaukar lokaci wajen ba da amsa madaidaiciya","Your quickest correct answer":"Amsa madaidaiciya da ka bayar cikin sauri mafi girma","Patterns you solved":"Tsare-tsaren da ka warware","A challenge worth sharing":"Kalubale da ya dace a raba shi da wasu","36 puzzles. One challenge.":"Tambayoyi 36. Kalubale guda ɗaya.","Share a challenge with someone you know.":"Raba kalubale tare da wani wanda ka sani.","Your own active time. There is not enough comparison data to rank its speed.":"Lokacin da ka ɗauka wajen aiki. Babu isassun bayanan kwatance don tantance saurin naka.","Choose what to share":"Zaɓi abin da za ka raba","Best moment":"Lokacin da ka fi fice","IQ estimate":"Ƙiyasin matakin basira (IQ)","Correct patterns":"Amsoshi madaidaiciya","Share on Facebook":"Raba a Facebook","Copy a personal caption":"Kwafi rubutun da za ka iya amfani da shi","Your share text":"Rubutun da za ka raba","Copy text":"Kwafi rubutu","Facebook lets you write your own caption. We never post automatically.":"Facebook yana ba ka damar rubuta naka bayanin. Ba ma taɓa yin wallafa ta atomatik ba.","Copied. Paste it into your post.":"An kwafi rubutun. Manna shi a cikin wallafarka.","Select and copy the text below.":"Zaɓi kuma ka kwafi rubutun da ke ƙasa.","Your question statistics":"Ƙididdigar tambayoyinka","Question comparisons are not available yet. Your personal statistics are shown below.":"Har yanzu babu bayanan kwatancen tambayoyi. Ana nuna ƙididdigarka ta musamman a ƙasa.","Times count visible, focused question time up to your last answer. For unanswered questions, time spent is shown. Hidden tabs and closed pages do not count. Earlier attempts may have no timings.":"Ana lissafin lokacin da aka kashe wajen mai da hankali kan tambaya har zuwa lokacin da aka bayar da amsa ta ƙarshe. Ga tambayoyin da ba a amsa ba, ana nuna lokacin da aka kashe a kansu. Ba a lissafin lokacin da shafuka suke a ɓoye ko kuma lokacin da aka rufe shafuka. Yiwuwar cewa ƙoƙarin da aka yi a baya ba su da bayanan lokaci.","All 36 questions, including skipped questions":"Dukkan tambayoyi 36, gami da waɗanda aka tsallake","Question":"Tambaya","Your time":"Lokacinka","Correct-answer median":"Matsakaicin lokacin amsawa daidai","Others correct":"Amsoshin daidai na wasu","Compare with voluntary attempts using the same puzzle version. At least 30 answered questions are needed for a correct rate, and 30 timed correct answers for a median. These are participants, not a representative population.":"Yi kwatance da waɗanda suka yi ƙoƙarin amsawa bisa radin kansu ta amfani da sigar wasan iri ɗaya. Ana buƙatar aƙalla tambayoyi 30 da aka amsa don samun ƙimar daidaito, da kuma amsoshi 30 da aka bayar daidai a cikin lokaci da aka auna don samun matsakaicin lokaci. Waɗannan mutane ne da suka shiga, ba wakilan dukkan al'umma ba ne.","Compare and contribute":"Yi kwatance kuma ka ba da gudummawa","Help future participants compare their results. You can share anonymous test statistics after finishing, even if you skipped questions.":"Taimaka wa waɗanda za su zo nan gaba wajen kwatanta sakamakonsu. Bayan kammalawa, za ka iya raba bayanan ƙididdiga na gwajin ba tare da bayyana sunanka ba, ko da kuwa ka tsallake wasu tambayoyi.","Anonymous comparisons are being prepared. Your personal statistics and sharing work without contributing.":"Ana shirya kwatance ba tare da bayyana sunaye ba. Bayanan ƙididdiga naka na sirri za a iya rabawa ba tare da an haɗa su cikin bayanan gudummawar jama'a ba.","Age group (optional)":"Rukunin shekaru (na zaɓi)","Country (optional)":"Ƙasa (na zaɓi)","Prefer not to say":"Ban so in faɗa ba","Under 18":"Ƙasa da shekaru 18","I agree to contribute my anonymous question results and active times, together with any age group and country I choose, to comparison statistics.":"Na yarda in ba da gudummawar sakamakon tambayoyina da lokutan da na ɗauka wajen amsawa—ba tare da bayyana sunana ba—tare da rukunin shekaru da ƙasar da na zaɓa, domin a yi amfani da su wajen ƙididdigar kwatance.","No name, email or exact age. Sharing your statistics is optional and does not affect your result. Small comparison groups are hidden.":"Ba a buƙatar suna, imel, ko ainihin shekaru. Raba bayanan ƙididdiga naka na zaɓi ne kuma ba zai shafi sakamakonka ba. Ƙananan rukunin kwatance ba za a nuna su ba.","Contribute anonymously":"Ba da gudummawa ba tare da bayyana suna ba","Why this answer?":"Me ya sa aka ba da wannan amsar?","Explanation":"Bayani","The rule":"Dokar","Applying the rule":"Yadda ake amfani da dokar","You are reviewing an older puzzle version. Its examples contain the previously identified ambiguity; your saved answer and score are unchanged.":"Kana duba tsohuwar sigar wasan. Misalan da ke cikinta sun ƙunshi rashin tabbas ɗin da aka gano a baya; amsar da maki da ka adana ba su canza ba.","You are reviewing the original version, which contained incorrect example markers. Your saved answer and score are unchanged. New attempts use the corrected version.":"Kana duba ainihin sigar farko, wadda ta ƙunshi alamomin misalai da ba su daidaita ba. Amsar da maki da ka adana ba su canza ba. Sabbin ƙoƙarce-ƙoƙarce suna amfani da sigar da aka gyara.","In this original version, the displayed middle picture expands to green at the top right and row 2, column 3; red at row 2, column 1; and brown at row 2, column 2, row 3, column 3 and row 4, column 3.":"A cikin wannan ainihin sigar, hoton da ke tsakiya ya faɗaɗa zuwa launin kore a ɓangaren sama na dama da kuma layin 2, shafi na 3; launin ja a layin 2, shafi na 1; da kuma launin ruwan kasa a layin 2, shafi na 2, layin 3, shafi na 3, da kuma layin 4, shafi na 3.","Share result on Facebook":"Raba sakamakon a Facebook","Share test on Facebook":"Raba gwajin a Facebook","Estimated IQ":"Kiyasin matakin basira (IQ)","Just for fun. An approximate score, not a professionally validated IQ measurement.":"Don nishaɗi kawai. Wannan kiyasin maki ne, ba ingantaccen awo na matakin basira (IQ) da ƙwararru suka tabbatar ba.","Your test is incomplete. Your correct answers are shown, but an IQ estimate needs all 36 answers.":"Gwajinka bai cika ba. An nuna amsoshinka daidai, amma don samun kiyasin matakin basira (IQ), ana buƙatar amsoshi duka 36.","Unavailable":"Ba ya samuwa","Free visual reasoning test | IQ Champion":"Gwajin tunani ta hanyar gani (visual reasoning) kyauta | IQ Champion","36 visual reasoning puzzles. Take a free 40-minute challenge and explore your results.":"Tambayoyin tunani ta hanyar gani guda 36. Gwada ƙwarewarka a cikin minti 40 kyauta, sannan ka duba sakamakonka.","Answered":"An amsa","Unanswered":"Ba a amsa ba","Correct":"Daidai","Incorrect":"Ba daidai ba","Close":"Rufe","Help":"Taimako","40 min":"Minti 40","Language":"Harshe","About the test":"Game da gwajin","A challenge in visual reasoning":"Kalubale a fannin tunani ta hanyar gani","Spot the pattern.":"Gano tsarin da aka bi.","Find the missing piece.":"Nemo ɓangaren da ya ɓace.","36 visual puzzles and an estimated IQ score. Just for fun.":"Tambayoyin tunani ta hanyar gani guda 36 da kuma kiyasin matakin basira (IQ). Don nishaɗi kawai.","Puzzles":"Tambayoyi/Wasanin gwada hankali","Time limit":"Iyakar lokaci","Cost":"Kuɗi","Free":"Kyauta","No account needed. The timer starts when you begin.":"Ba a buƙatar buɗe asusu. Agogon ƙidayar lokaci zai fara aiki da zarar ka fara gwajin.","How the test works":"Yadda gwajin yake aiki","Choose the icon that completes each pattern.":"Zaɓi alamar da ta cika kowane tsari.","Skip tricky questions and return using the overview.":"Za ka iya tsallake tambayoyi masu wuya sannan ka koma gare su ta hanyar amfani da shafin duba dukkan tambayoyin.","Review or change your answers before you finish.":"Duba ko canza amsoshinka kafin ka kammala.","Your answers and start time are saved in this browser. Reloading keeps your original deadline.":"An adana amsoshinka da lokacin da ka fara a cikin wannan manhajar binciken yanar gizo (browser). Sake loda shafin ba zai canza wa'adin lokacin da aka kayyade ba.","The 40-minute timer continues while the page is closed. Unanswered questions count as incorrect.":"Agogon kirgawa na minti 40 zai ci gaba da aiki ko da an rufe shafin. Tambayoyin da ba a amsa ba za a dauke su a matsayin wadanda ba daidai ba.","About your result":"Game da sakamakonka","Your estimated IQ is based on your position among":"An kiyasta matakin basirarka (IQ) ne bisa la'akari da matsayinka a tsakanin","historical attempts.":"gwaje-gwajen da aka yi a baya.","The comparison uses attempts lasting over one minute and up to 40 minutes. It has not been validated against an official IQ test or a representative population sample.":"Wannan kwatancen ya dogara ne kan gwaje-gwajen da suka dauki tsawon lokaci fiye da minti daya har zuwa minti 40. Ba a tabbatar da ingancinsa ta hanyar gwajin IQ na hukuma ko ta hanyar amfani da wakilan al'umma ba.","A test for fun. Your estimated IQ is an approximation, not a professionally validated IQ score.":"Gwajin nishadi ne kawai. Kiyasin IQ din da aka bayar kiyasi ne na kusanci, ba sakamakon IQ ba ne da kwararru suka tabbatar da ingancinsa.","Start 40-minute test":"Fara gwajin na minti 40","Reasoning test":"Gwajin tunani da fahimta","Your challenge":"Kalubalenka","Time remaining":"Lokacin da ya rage","remaining":"ya rage","Question pattern":"Tsarin tambayoyi","Find the pattern":"Gano tsarin","Four rows of visual patterns; complete the last row":"Layuka hudu na tsare-tsaren zane; cike layin karshe","Choose your answer":"Zabi amsarka","Question navigation":"Kewaya tsakanin tambayoyi","Previous question":"Tambayar da ta gabata","Skip for now":"Tsallake a yanzu","Next question":"Tambaya ta gaba","Question overview":"Duba dukkan tambayoyi","✓ Answered":"✓ An amsa","○ Unanswered":"○ Ba a amsa ba","Outline = current":"Alama = tambayar da ake kai a yanzu","Jump to a question":"Je zuwa wata tambaya","Review and finish":"Duba sannan ka kammala","Instructions & saved progress":"Umarni & ci gaban da aka adana","Pick an answer to move to the next unanswered question. You can skip, return and change answers before finishing.":"Zabi amsa domin ci gaba zuwa tambaya ta gaba da ba a amsa ba. Za ka iya tsallake tambaya, komawa baya, da kuma canza amsoshi kafin ka kammala.","Answers save automatically in this browser. Reloading resumes the same question; your timer keeps running.":"Amsoshinka suna adana kansu ta atomatik a cikin wannan manhajar binciken yanar gizo (browser). Idan ka sake loda shafin, za ka ci gaba daga inda ka tsaya; agogon kirga lokacinka kuma zai ci gaba da aiki.","Ready when you are":"A shirye muke idan kai ma ka shirya","Finish this test?":"Kammala wannan gwajin?","Keep working":"Ci gaba da aiki","Finish and see result":"Kammala don ganin sakamako","Challenge complete":"An kammala kalubalen","Your result":"Sakamakonka","Review answers":"Duba amsoshi","Try again":"Gwada sake yi","About this test":"Game da wannan gwajin","How to read this result":"Yadda ake fahimtar wannan sakamakon","Your percentile among historical attempts is converted to the familiar IQ scale: midpoint 100 and standard deviation 15. This assumes the comparison group reflects the population, which has not been established.":"Matsayinka (percentile) idan aka kwatanta da na wadanda suka yi gwajin a baya, an canza shi zuwa ma'aunin IQ da aka saba amfani da shi: inda tsakiyar yake 100, kuma bambancin ma'auni (standard deviation) yake 15. Wannan ya dogara ne kan hasashen cewa rukunin da aka yi kwatancen da su yana wakiltar dukkan al'umma, amma har yanzu ba a tabbatar da hakan ba.","Your answers, explained":"Bayani kan amsoshinka","Review your answers":"Duba amsoshinka","Back to result":"Komawa ga sakamako","The pattern":"Tsarin","Compare the answers":"Kwatanta amsoshin","Your answer":"Amsarka","Correct answer":"Amsar da ta dace","Previous review question":"Tambayar da ta gabata","Next review question":"Tambaya ta gaba","Results by question":"Sakamako bisa ga kowace tambaya","Explore all 36 puzzles":"Duba dukkan kalubale (puzzles) guda 36","✓ Correct":"✓ Daidai","× Incorrect":"× Ba daidai ba","Review a question":"Duba wata tambaya","Your submitted answers and final score stay unchanged.":"Amsoshin da ka riga ka mika da kuma maki na karshe ba za su canza ba.","Contact":"Tuntuba","Feedback & contact":"Ra'ayoyi & tuntuba","Send feedback or contact us":"Aika ra'ayi ko a tuntube mu","Correct. Your answer matches the correct answer.":"Daidai. Amsarka ta yi daidai da amsar da ta dace.","Incorrect. Your answer differs from the correct answer.":"Ba daidai ba. Amsarka ta sha bamban da amsar da ta dace.","Unanswered. No answer was submitted for this question.":"Ba a amsa ba. Ba a bayar da amsa ga wannan tambayar ba.","No answer submitted":"Ba a bayar da amsa ba","Your submitted answer":"Amsar da ka bayar","Missing icon":"Alamar da ta ɓace","All questions are answered. You can still review and change answers, then finish the test.":"An amsa dukkan tambayoyin. Har yanzu za ka iya duba da kuma canza amsoshin, sannan ka kammala jarabawar.","Five minutes or less remaining.":"Ya rage minti biyar ko kasa da haka.","Time is up. Your answers have been scored.":"Lokaci ya ƙare. An yi wa amsoshinka maki.","Test completed.":"An kammala jarabawar.","Comparison unavailable.":"Ba za a iya yin kwatance ba.","This browser could not save your attempt. Keep this page open: reloading may lose progress or restore older answers.":"Wannan manhajar binciken yanar gizo (browser) ba ta sami damar adana kokarinka ba. A bar shafin a buɗe: sake ɗora shafin (reloading) na iya sa a rasa abin da aka yi ko kuma a dawo da tsoffin amsoshi.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. Keep this page open to avoid losing your attempt.":"Ba za a iya adana bayanai a na'urar ba ta hanyar wannan manhajar binciken yanar gizo. A bar shafin a buɗe domin gudun rasa kokarinka.","The saved attempt could not be restored. Start a new test when you are ready.":"Ba za a iya dawo da kokarin da aka adana ba. Fara sabuwar jarabawa idan ka shirya.","Keep the figure unchanged":"A bar adadin yadda yake","Every position in each example row contains the same blue circle. Neither the shape, colour nor size changes.":"Kowane wuri a cikin layukan misalan ya ƙunshi da'ira mai launin shuɗi iri ɗaya. Siffar, launin, da girman ba sa canzawa.","The last row already contains two identical blue circles. Another identical blue circle completes it.":"Layin ƙarshe ya riga ya ƙunshi da'irori biyu masu launin shuɗi waɗanda suke kama da juna. Wata da'irar mai launin shuɗi, wadda take kama da sauran, ta cika layin.","Add one nested outline":"Ƙara wani zane a ciki","Moving right adds a smaller outline of the same shape inside the previous one. The outer shape and its colour stay unchanged.":"Matsawa zuwa dama yana ƙara wani zane mai ƙanƙanta, mai siffa iri ɗaya, a cikin zanen da ke ciki a baya. Zanen waje da launinsa ba sa canzawa.","The green triangle has one inner triangle in the middle position. Add one more, smaller inner triangle to obtain the answer.":"Alwatika mai launin kore tana da wata alwatika a ciki, a tsakiya. Ƙara wata alwatika a ciki, wadda ta fi waccan ƙanƙanta, domin samun amsar.","Use the first shape as a cut-out":"Yi amfani da siffar farko a matsayin abin yanka","The black shape in the first position is removed from the centre of the coloured square in the second position. The hole is white.":"An cire siffar baƙa da ke wuri na farko daga tsakiyar murabba'i mai launi da ke wuri na biyu. Ramin da ya rage yana da launin fari.","The black square makes a square hole in the green square. Choose the green square with the white square opening.":"Murabba'i mai launin baƙi yana haifar da rami mai siffar murabba'i a cikin murabba'i mai launin kore. Zaɓi murabba'in kore ɗin da ke da rami mai siffar murabba'i mai launin fari.","Combine the upper and lower colours":"Haɗa launukan da ke sama da waɗanda ke ƙasa","The result takes its upper half from the first capsule and its lower half from the second capsule.":"Sakamakon ya ƙunshi rabin sama daga siffar farko (mai kama da kwantini) da kuma rabin ƙasa daga siffar ta biyu.","The first capsule is white and the second is blue, so the result is white above and blue below.":"Siffar farko tana da launin fari, ta biyu kuma tana da launin shuɗi; don haka, sakamakon yana da launin fari a sama da kuma launin shuɗi a ƙasa.","Rotate the coloured lobes":"Juya sassan da ke da launi","At each step, turn the whole four-lobed figure 90 degrees clockwise. Every red and blue lobe moves with the figure.":"A kowane mataki, juya dukkan siffar mai sassan nan huɗu da digiri 90 ta hanyar da agogo ke tafiya. Duk wani sashe mai launin ja ko shuɗi yana juyawa tare da siffar.","Turn the middle figure another quarter-turn clockwise. The two red lobes finish on the right and at the bottom; the top and left lobes are blue.":"Juya siffar da ke tsakiya da wani kwata na juyawa ta hanyar da agogo ke tafiya. Sassan biyu masu launin ja za su kasance a dama da kuma ƙasa; sassan da ke sama da hagu kuma za su kasance masu launin shuɗi.","Round the corners progressively":"Sanya kusurwoyin su zama masu lankwasa a hankali","The colour and general shape remain the same while the corners become more rounded at each step.":"Launi da siffar gaba ɗaya ba sa canzawa, amma kusurwoyin suna ƙara zama masu lankwasa a kowane mataki.","Continue rounding the corners of the brown rectangle. The answer is the brown capsule with fully rounded ends.":"Ci gaba da zagayaye kusurwoyin siffar mai kusurwa huɗu mai launin ruwan kasa. Sakamakon shine siffar da ke da siffar kwayar magani mai launin ruwan kasa, wacce dukkan bangarorinta biyu suke zagaye.","Continue the circle’s movement":"Ci gaba da motsin da da'irar ke yi.","Within each row the green circle moves the same distance in the same direction: upward, downward or horizontally. Its size stays fixed.":"A kowane layi, da'irar mai launin kore tana tafiya nesa iri daya a alkibla daya: sama, kasa, ko a kwance. Girman da'irar baya canzawa.","In the last row the circle moves left along the bottom of the square. One more equal step places it at the bottom left.":"A layi na karshe, da'irar tana tafiya zuwa hagu a gefen kasa na siffar mai kusurwa huɗu. Wani mataki daya na daban zai sanya ta a kusurwar kasa ta hagu.","Turn the entire dot pattern":"Juya dukkan tsarin dige-digen.","Rotate the square and all its dots 45 degrees counterclockwise at each step. The square becomes a diamond, then a square again.":"A kowane mataki, juya siffar mai kusurwa huɗu da dukkan dige-digen da ke cikinta da digiri 45 zuwa akasin alkiblar agogo. Siffar za ta koma siffar lu'u-lu'u, sannan ta sake komawa siffar mai kusurwa huɗu.","Turn the middle green-and-black diamond another 45 degrees counterclockwise. Keep the green and black dots in their rotated positions.":"Juya siffar lu'u-lu'u mai launin kore da baki da ke tsakiya da wasu digiri 45 zuwa akasin alkiblar agogo. A bar dige-digen kore da baki a wuraren da suka kasance bayan juyawar.","Shorten each bar from the top":"Rage tsawon kowane layi daga sama.","At every step, each vertical black bar loses one grid interval from its upper end. Its lower end stays on the bottom line. A bar disappears when its length reaches zero.":"A kowane mataki, kowane layi mai tsayi mai launin baki yana raguwa da tazara daya daga bangarensa na sama. Bangarensa na kasa yana nan a kan layin kasa. Layin zai bace gaba daya idan tsawonsa ya zama sifili.","The middle picture has a one-interval middle bar and a two-interval right bar. The middle bar disappears, leaving a one-interval bar on the right.":"Hoton da ke tsakiya yana da layi mai tsawon tazara daya a tsakiya, da kuma layi mai tsawon tazara biyu a dama. Layin da ke tsakiya ya bace, inda ya bar layi mai tsawon tazara daya a dama.","Reflect across the black line":"Yi madubi (juyawa ta hanyar nuna a madubi) ta amfani da layin baki.","The middle line is a mirror axis. Reflect the coloured shape in that line rather than simply rotating it.":"Layin da ke tsakiya yana aiki a matsayin madubi. Ka nuna siffar mai launi ta hanyar madubi a kan wannan layin, maimakon kawai ka juya ta.","The last mirror line is vertical, so the yellow shape is flipped left to right. Its colour and size remain unchanged.":"Layin madubi na karshe a tsaye yake, don haka siffar mai launin rawaya ta juya daga hagu zuwa dama. Launinta da girmanta ba su canza ba.","Overlay the shapes and use the first colour":"Sanya siffofin a kan juna sannan a yi amfani da launi na farko.","Place both shapes on top of one another. Keep the combined silhouette and the visible outlines, but colour the result with the first shape’s colour.":"Sanya siffofin biyu a kan juna. A ajiye siffar da aka samu ta hanyar hada su da kuma layukan da ke bayyane, amma a sanya wa sakamakon launi iri daya da na siffar farko.","Overlay the blue downward triangle and the yellow hexagon, then use blue for the combined figure. The triangle’s projecting tips remain visible around the hexagon.":"Rufe alwatika mai launin shuɗi da kuma hexagon rawaya, sannan a yi amfani da shuɗi don haɗakar siffar. Ƙofofin alwatika suna nan a bayyane a kusa da hexagon.","Keep green in exactly one input":"A ajiye kore a cikin shigarwa ɗaya kawai","Compare corresponding areas of the two squares. An area is green if it is green in exactly one input. Green in both cancels to white; white in both stays white.":"Kwatanta yankunan murabba'ai biyu masu dacewa. Yanki kore ne idan kore ne a cikin shigarwa ɗaya daidai. Kore a cikin duka biyun yana canzawa zuwa fari; fari a cikin duka biyun yana ci gaba da zama fari.","The first square is entirely green and the second has only a green bottom-left quarter. That shared quarter turns white; the other three quarters stay green.":"Murabba'in farko gaba ɗaya kore ne kuma na biyu yana da kwata kore kawai a ƙasa-hagu. Wannan kwata da aka raba yana canzawa fari; sauran kwata uku suna ci gaba da zama kore.","Attach a copy at every corner":"Haɗa kwafi a kowane kusurwa","Put a copy of the small black symbol at each vertex of the large shape. The added copies take the large shape’s colour.":"Sanya kwafin ƙaramin alamar baƙi a kowane kusurwa na babban siffar. Kwafi da aka ƙara suna ɗaukar launin babban siffar.","The large blue diamond has four corners. Add a blue downward triangle at each corner, following the same placement rule as the examples.":"Babban lu'u-lu'u mai shuɗi yana da kusurwoyi huɗu. Ƙara alwatika mai launin shuɗi a ƙasa a kowane kusurwa, bin ƙa'idar sanyawa iri ɗaya kamar misalan.","Add corresponding bar heights":"Ƙara tsayin sandunan da suka dace","For each of the three horizontal positions, add the black bar’s height in the first picture to its height in the second. Measure upwards from the common bottom line.":"Ga kowane matsayi uku na kwance, ƙara tsayin sandar baƙi a hoton farko zuwa tsayinsa a na biyu. Auna sama daga layin ƙasa na gama gari.","Neither input has a left bar. The two middle bars add to a full-height bar, while the right bars add to a shorter bar. The answer has just those middle and right bars.":"Babu ɗayan shigarwar da ke da sandar hagu. Sandunan tsakiya guda biyu suna ƙarawa sandar cikakken tsayi, yayin da sandunan dama suna ƙarawa sandar gajere. Amsar tana da waɗancan sandunan tsakiya da dama kawai.","Rotate and alternate colours":"Juya launuka kuma canza su","Turn the shape 45 degrees counterclockwise at each step. Its colour alternates, so the third picture returns to the first picture’s colour.":"Juya siffar digiri 45 a akasin agogo a kowane mataki. Launinta yana canzawa, don haka hoton na uku ya koma launin hoton farko.","Turn the white middle shape another 45 degrees counterclockwise and restore the dark colour from the first picture. Choose the dark curved shape in that orientation.":"Juya siffar tsakiyar fari zuwa digiri 45 a akasin agogo kuma dawo da launin duhu daga hoton farko. Zaɓi siffar mai lanƙwasa mai duhu a wannan yanayin.","Combine the black circles":"Haɗa da'irar baƙi","A circle is black in the result whenever the matching circle is black in either input. It is white only when both inputs have a white circle there.":"Da'ira baƙar fata ce a sakamakon duk lokacin da da'irar da ta dace ta yi baƙi a cikin kowane shigarwar. Fari ne kawai lokacin da shigarwar biyu ke da da'irar fari a wurin.","The first input contributes the bottom-right black circle; the second contributes the two top black circles. The centre and bottom-left circle stay white.":"Shigar farko tana ba da gudummawar da'irar baƙi ta ƙasa-dama; na biyu tana ba da gudummawar da'irar baƙi biyu na sama. Da'irar tsakiya da ƙasa-da-hagu suna kasancewa fari.","Expand into neighbouring cells":"Faɗaɗa zuwa ƙwayoyin maƙwabta","At each step, every blue cell remains blue and also colours its immediate neighbours above, below, left and right. Expansion stops at the grid boundary.":"A kowane mataki, kowace ƙwayar shuɗi ta kasance shuɗi kuma tana ba da launi ga maƙwabtanta na kusa sama, ƙasa, hagu da dama. Faɗaɗawa tana tsayawa a iyakar grid.","Apply the same one-cell expansion to the middle blue region. Newly reached side neighbours become blue; cells farther away remain in the grey-and-black checkerboard.":"Aiƙa faɗaɗawar tantanin halitta ɗaya zuwa yankin shuɗi na tsakiya. Maƙwabtan gefe da aka kai su zama shuɗi; ƙwayoyin halitta da ke nesa da su suna nan a cikin allon duba launin toka da baƙi.","Cancel matching brown positions":"Soke matsayin launin ruwan kasa mai dacewa","Compare the two five-cell strips position by position. A cell is brown in the result if exactly one input is brown there. Matching brown cells cancel to blue.":"Kwatanta matsayin tsiri biyu na tantanin halitta biyar ta wurin matsayi. Tantanin halitta yana launin ruwan kasa a sakamakon idan daidai shigarwa ɗaya ya yi launin ruwan kasa a wurin. Daidaita ƙwayoyin launin ruwan kasa yana sokewa zuwa shuɗi.","Brown occurs in positions 2, 3, 4 and 5 in the first strip and in positions 2, 3 and 5 in the second. Only position 4 remains brown.":"Ruwan kasa yana faruwa a matsayi na 2, 3, 4 da 5 a tsiri na farko da kuma matsayi na 2, 3 da 5 a na biyu. Matsayi na 4 kawai ya rage launin ruwan kasa.","Remove the closest red dots":"Cire digo ja mafi kusa","Find the smallest distance between any two red dots. Remove every red dot belonging to a pair at that distance. Recalculate the closest distance for the next step.":"Nemo mafi ƙarancin nisa tsakanin kowace digo ja biyu. Cire kowane digo ja na biyu a wannan nisa. Sake ƙididdige mafi kusa don mataki na gaba.","In the middle picture, the three lower red dots participate in the closest diagonal pairs. Removing them leaves only the red dot in the top row, fourth column.":"A hoton tsakiya, ƙananan digogi uku ja suna shiga cikin ma'auratan diagonal mafi kusa. Cire su yana barin digo ja kawai a layi na sama, shafi na huɗu.","Move the six colours around a cycle":"Matsar da launuka shida a kusa da zagaye","Read down the left stack, then down the right stack. Shift every colour one position forward in that six-position cycle; the bottom-right colour wraps to the top left.":"Karanta ƙasa tari na hagu, sannan ƙasa tari na dama. Canza kowane launi matsayi ɗaya gaba a cikin wannan zagayen matsayi shida; launin ƙasa-dama yana naɗewa zuwa saman hagu.","From the middle picture, the bottom-right brown circle wraps to the top left. The final stacks are brown/red/red on the left and black/brown/blue on the right.":"Daga hoton tsakiya, da'irar launin ruwan kasa ta ƙasa-dama tana naɗewa zuwa saman hagu. Tari na ƙarshe launin ruwan kasa/ja/ja a hagu da baƙi/kasa/shuɗi a dama.","Move white and black in opposite directions":"Matsar da fari da baƙi a cikin kwatance daban-daban","White circles move one corner clockwise and black circles move one corner counterclockwise at each step. Grey means that a white and a black circle occupy the same corner; separate them before moving again.":"Fari da'ira suna motsawa kusurwa ɗaya a hannun agogo kuma baƙi suna motsawa kusurwa ɗaya a hannun agogo a kowane mataki. Toka yana nufin cewa fari da baƙi suna mamaye kusurwa ɗaya; raba su kafin sake motsawa.","The middle picture contains white circles at the two left corners and black circles at the two left corners and bottom right. Moving them gives white at top left, grey at top right, and black at both bottom corners.":"Hoton tsakiya ya ƙunshi fararen da'ira a kusurwoyin hagu biyu da baƙi a kusurwoyin hagu biyu da ƙasa dama. Motsa su yana ba da fari a saman hagu, launin toka a saman dama, da baƙi a kusurwoyin ƙasa biyu.","Extend every horizontal stroke":"Miƙa kowane bugun kwance","At each step, extend each black horizontal stroke into the immediately neighbouring capsule on both sides. Existing strokes remain, and strokes stop at the outside edges.":"A kowane mataki, miƙa kowane bugun kwance baƙi zuwa cikin ƙwayar maƙwabta a ɓangarorin biyu. Shafukan da ke akwai suna nan, kuma shafukan suna tsayawa a gefunan waje.","Extend the strokes in the middle picture one more capsule left and right. Keep separate stroke heights distinct; the answer shows the resulting longer horizontal lines across the four capsules.":"Miƙa bugun a cikin hoton tsakiya ƙarin ƙwayar magani ɗaya hagu da dama. Kiyaye tsayin bugun daban-daban; amsar tana nuna layukan kwance masu tsayi da suka fito a kan ƙwayoyin magani huɗu.","Grow the triangular lattice":"Girman layin triangle","Treat the drawing as a group of small triangles. At each step, add a small triangle just outside every exposed edge, keeping the existing triangles and their connecting lines.":"Yi amfani da zane a matsayin rukuni na ƙananan alwatika. A kowane mataki, ƙara ƙaramin alwatika a wajen kowane gefen da aka fallasa, kiyaye alwatika da ke akwai da layukan haɗinsu.","Grow the middle green cluster by one more layer of neighbouring triangles. The answer keeps the same triangular grid and adds the triangles along its outside edges.":"Girman tsakiyar kore ta hanyar wani Layer na alwatika maƙwabta. Amsar tana riƙe da grid ɗin alwatika iri ɗaya kuma tana ƙara alwatika tare da gefunan waje.","Remove the marked vertices":"Cire wuraren da aka yiwa alama","The brown dots identify vertices of the black polygon to remove. Connect the remaining vertices in their original order. Two remaining vertices produce a line segment.":"Digogin launin ruwan kasa suna gano wuraren da baƙar fata ke amfani da su don cirewa. Haɗa sauran wuraren da aka yi amfani da su a cikin tsari na asali. Sauran wurare biyu suna samar da sashin layi.","Remove the top and left vertices marked by the brown dots. Only the two lower vertices remain, so the answer is the short horizontal line near the bottom right.":"Cire wuraren da aka yi alama da digo-digo na sama da hagu. Ƙananan wurare biyu ne kawai suka rage, don haka amsar ita ce gajeren layin kwance kusa da ƙasan dama.","Toggle the dots at the outline’s corners":"Canja ɗigo a kusurwoyin zane","Match the black outline’s vertices to the 3-by-3 dot positions. At each vertex, remove an existing blue dot or add one if the position is empty. Other positions stay unchanged.":"Haɗa ɗigogin zane mai duhu da matsayin ɗigo 3-by-3. A kowane kusurwa, cire digon shuɗi idan yana nan, ko kuma a sanya shi idan wurin babu komai. Sauran wuraren ba za su canza ba.","Toggle the four corner positions of the slanted outline. The result has blue dots at top left and top middle, middle middle and middle right, and all three bottom positions.":"Canza yanayin wurare huɗu na kusurwoyin siffar da ke a karkace. Sakamakon zai kasance yana da dige-dige masu launin shuɗi a: saman hagu da tsakiyar sama, tsakiyar tsakiya da tsakiyar dama, da kuma dukkan wurare uku na ƙasa.","Remove the marked brick and its neighbours":"Cire tubalin da aka yi wa alama da kuma tubalan da ke kusa da shi.","First remove the red brick and every brick sharing an edge with it, then let unsupported bricks fall straight down. Repeat the same process with the yellow brick.":"Da farko, cire tubalin ja da duk tubalan da ke haɗe da shi (ta gefe ɗaya). Bayan haka, bar tubalan da ba su da abin da ke tallafa musu su faɗi ƙasa kai tsaye. Maimaita wannan tsari ga tubalin mai launin rawaya.","After the red removal, the remaining bricks form the middle staircase. Removing the yellow brick and its touching neighbours leaves the upper blue brick, which falls to the bottom.":"Bayan cire tubalin ja, tubalan da suka rage sun samar da matakalar tsakiya. Cire tubalin rawaya da makwabtansa da ke taba shi, zai bar tubalin shudi na sama, wanda zai fado zuwa kasa.","Cycle the layers and apply the colour mask":"Juya matakan (layers) sannan a sanya tsarin launuka a kai.","Track the same three shapes. At each step the front shape goes to the back. For the final picture, keep the middle picture’s grey or black fills; its unfilled white shapes regain their colours from the first picture.":"Bi sawun siffofi uku guda daya. A kowane mataki, siffar da ke gaba tana komawa baya. Ga hoton karshe, a rike launin toka ko baki na hoton tsakiya; siffofin fari da ba su da launi a ciki za su dawo da launukansu na asali daga hoton farko.","The grey hexagon comes to the front, the black horizontal capsule lies behind it, and the vertical capsule moves to the back. That white vertical capsule regains its original yellow colour.":"Siffar kusurwa shida (hexagon) mai launin toka tana zuwa gaba, siffar dogo mai lankwasa (capsule) mai launin baki tana kwance a bayanta, yayin da siffar dogo mai lankwasa a tsaye take komawa baya. Wannan siffar dogo mai lankwasa a tsaye mai launin fari tana komawa launinta na asali, wato rawaya.","Use each circle’s colour to find its motion":"Yi amfani da launin kowane da'ira don gano yadda take motsi.","Track each circle relative to the circle immediately around it. White moves 90 degrees clockwise, black moves 90 degrees counterclockwise, and red stays in the same relative position. Blue does not move. Apply these movements to every nested level.":"Bi motsin kowane da'ira dangane da da'irar da ke kewaye da shi kai tsaye. Da'ira mai launin fari tana motsi digiri 90 ta hanyar agogo, mai launin baki tana motsi digiri 90 akasin hanyar agogo, yayin da mai launin ja ta tsaya a inda take. Mai launin shudi ba ta motsi ba. A yi amfani da wadannan motsi a kowane mataki na siffofi da ke ciki-ciki.","The black circle moves from above the blue circle to its left. Red stays to the right inside black. The larger white circle moves from above red to its right; the smallest white circle moves from below the larger white circle to its left.":"Da'ira mai launin baki tana motsi daga saman da'ira mai launin shudi zuwa hagunta. Mai launin ja tana nan a dama, a cikin mai launin baki. Babbar da'ira mai launin fari tana motsi daga saman mai launin ja zuwa damanta; karamar da'ira mai launin fari tana motsi daga kasan babbar da'ira mai launin fari zuwa hagunta.","Move colours along the connected routes":"Motsa launuka tare da hanyoyin da ke hade da juna.","The black links specify the routes along which the colours move. Follow each loop clockwise, moving each colour to the next connected position. A two-position route swaps its colours; unconnected dots stay put.":"Layukan baki suna nuna hanyoyin da launuka ke bi wajen motsi. Bi kowane zagaye ta hanyar agogo, tare da matsar da kowane launi zuwa matsayi na gaba da ke da alaka da shi. Hanyar da ke da wurare biyu kawai tana musanya launukanta; yayin da dige-dige da ba su da alaka da wasu ba sa canza wurinsu.","Swap the two top colours. On the lower loop, the left-middle blue moves to the centre and the right-middle red moves to the bottom left. The unconnected bottom-right red stays unchanged.":"Musanya launuka biyu na sama. A zagayen kasa, launin shudi da ke tsakiya-hagu yana komawa tsakiya, yayin da launin ja da ke tsakiya-dama yana komawa kasa-hagu. Launin ja da ke kasa-dama, wanda ba shi da alaka da wasu, yana nan yadda yake.","Move each colour along its own path":"Matsar da kowace launi a kan hanyarsa","Red moves down, green moves right and yellow moves left. Blue moves up and, where possible, one column left. White marks overlapping colours; separate those colours again when applying the next move. Colours moving beyond the grid disappear.":"Ja tana motsawa ƙasa, kore tana motsawa dama da rawaya tana motsawa hagu. Shuɗi tana motsawa sama, kuma, inda zai yiwu, shafi ɗaya a hagu. Farin yana nuna launuka; sake raba waɗannan launukan lokacin amfani da motsi na gaba. Launuka da ke wucewa ta hanyar grid suna ɓacewa.","Separate the middle white cell into red and green. Red moves to bottom middle, green to middle right, blue reaches top left and yellow exits on the left. Those three coloured cells form the answer.":"Raba tsakiyar farin tantanin halitta zuwa ja da kore. Ja yana motsawa zuwa ƙasan tsakiya, kore zuwa tsakiya dama, shuɗi yana kaiwa sama hagu da rawaya yana fita a hagu. Waɗannan ƙwayoyin halitta masu launi uku suna samar da amsar.","Move red and blue tips in opposite directions":"Matsar da ja da shuɗi a cikin kwatance daban-daban","At each step, every red tip moves one position counterclockwise and every blue tip moves two positions clockwise around the five-pointed star. White means that red and blue overlap; separate both colours before moving again.":"A kowane mataki, kowane ja yana motsawa matsayi ɗaya a akasin agogo kuma kowane ja yana motsawa matsayi biyu a kusa da tauraro mai maki biyar. Fari yana nufin ja da shuɗi suna haɗuwa; raba launuka biyu kafin sake motsawa.","In the middle picture, red is at the lower right and blue is at the upper right and upper left. The next move puts red and one blue together at the upper right, making it white. The other blue moves to the lower left.":"A hoto na tsakiya, ja yana ƙasan dama kuma shuɗi yana sama da hagu na sama. Mataki na gaba yana sanya ja da shuɗi ɗaya a saman dama, yana mai da shi fari. Ɗayan shuɗin yana motsawa zuwa ƙasan hagu.","Shift two copies in the sector’s directions":"Canja kwafi biyu a cikin alkiblar ɓangaren","The two edges of the white sector indicate two movement directions. Make two copies of the red-dot pattern and shift one copy one grid step in each direction, wrapping at the edges. A position reached once is red; a position reached by both copies is blue.":"Gefuna biyu na ɓangaren fari suna nuna alkiblar motsi guda biyu. Yi kwafi biyu na tsarin ja-dogo kuma canza kwafi ɗaya mataki ɗaya na grid a kowane alkibla, yana naɗewa a gefuna. Matsayin da aka isa sau ɗaya ja ne; matsayin da kwafi biyu suka isa shine shuɗi.","The final sector points down-left and down-right. Shift a copy each way. Their overlap makes the entire top row and the centre blue; the single-copy positions remain red, as shown in the answer.":"Sashen ƙarshe yana nuna ƙasa-hagu da ƙasa-dama. Canja kwafi kowane hanya. Haɗakar su yana sa duk layin sama da tsakiyar shuɗi; matsayin kwafi ɗaya ya kasance ja, kamar yadda aka nuna a cikin amsar.","Remove crossing string segments":"Cire sassan igiyoyin da suka ketare","Overlay both drawings. Treat each straight piece between successive grid dots as a separate string segment. When a segment from one drawing crosses a segment from the other between dots, remove both segments. Segments meeting at a grid dot stay. Keep all uncut segments from both drawings.":"A rufe zane-zanen biyu. Yi wa kowane yanki madaidaiciya tsakanin ɗigon grid a jere a matsayin ɓangaren igiya daban. Idan wani ɓangare daga zane ɗaya ya haɗu da wani sashe daga ɗayan tsakanin ɗigo, cire duka sassan. Sassan da suka haɗu a kan maki na grid suna tsayawa. A ajiye duk sassan da ba a yanke ba daga zane-zanen biyu.","Remove the diagonal segments cut between the grid dots. The remaining pieces form an upper fork with a vertical stem, two detached short diagonals near the top corners, and a lower fork with its own vertical stem.":"Cire sassan diagonal da aka yanke tsakanin maki na grid. Sauran sassan suna samar da cokali mai yatsu na sama tare da tushe a tsaye, gajerun diagonal guda biyu da aka raba kusa da kusurwoyin sama, da kuma cokali mai yatsu na ƙasa tare da tushe a tsaye.","Slide and sort the pieces by size":"Zamewa kuma a tsara sassan bisa girman","Push all pieces in the arrow’s direction. Smaller pieces pass larger pieces and reach the furthest available spaces first. Keep every piece’s height and vertical position. Pieces may share a column if they do not overlap vertically; equal-sized pieces keep their relative order.":"A tura dukkan sassan a alkiblar kibiya. Ƙananan sassan suna wucewa manyan sassan kuma suna isa ga wurare mafi nisa da ake da su da farko. A riƙe tsayin kowane yanki da matsayinsa a tsaye. Guda-guda na iya raba ginshiƙi idan ba su haɗu a tsaye ba; gundarin daidai gwargwado suna kiyaye tsarinsu na dangi.","The arrow points right. Fit the shortest pieces into the available spaces on the right, then the two-cell pieces, then the taller pieces to their left. Nothing moves up or down, and no piece changes size.":"Kibiyar tana nuna dama. Sanya gundarin sassan a cikin wuraren da ake da su a dama, sannan gundarin sassan sel biyu, sannan gundarin sassan da ke hagunsu. Babu abin da ke motsawa sama ko ƙasa, kuma babu wani gundarin da ya canza girma.","Move the dividers into free spaces":"Matsar da masu rabawa zuwa wurare masu 'yanci","All black dividers simultaneously move one position to the right if the next position contains a yellow bead. A divider blocked by another divider waits. The right edge connects to the left edge.":"Dukkan masu rarrabawa (dividers) masu launin baƙi za su yi motsi zuwa dama mataki ɗaya a lokaci guda, idan matsayin da ke gaba ya ƙunshi ƙwallo mai launin rawaya. Idan wani mai rarrabawa ya toshe wani, to wanda aka toshe ɗin zai tsaya cak. Gefen dama yana haɗe da gefen hagu.","Apply one simultaneous step to the middle sequence. The final order is divider, bead, divider, bead, divider, divider, bead.":"A aiwatar da motsi ɗaya na lokaci guda ga jerin abubuwan da ke tsakiya. Tsarin ƙarshe zai kasance: mai rarrabawa, ƙwallo, mai rarrabawa, ƙwallo, mai rarrabawa, mai rarrabawa, ƙwallo.","Expand the colours and keep the largest group":"Faɗaɗa launukan sannan a ajiye rukuni mafi girma.","Replace every coloured ball with four new balls of the same colour, one step above, below, left and right. Balls leaving the grid disappear. At each position, keep the colour with the largest number of arriving balls. If colours tie for the largest number, leave the position empty. Several arrivals of the same colour appear as one coloured marker.":"A maye gurbin kowace ƙwallo mai launi da sabbin ƙwallaye guda huɗu masu launin iri ɗaya; ɗaya a sama, ɗaya a ƙasa, ɗaya a hagu, kuma ɗaya a dama. Ƙwallayen da suka fita daga kan jadawalin za su ɓace. A kowane matsayi, a ajiye launin da ya fi yawan ƙwallaye a wurin. Idan launuka suka yi daidai wajen yawa, to a bar matsayin babu komai. Idan ƙwallaye masu launi iri ɗaya suka taru a wuri ɗaya, za a ɗauke su a matsayin alama ɗaya mai wancan launin.","Expanding the displayed middle picture leaves green at the top right and at row 2, column 3; red at row 2, column 1; and brown at row 2, column 2, row 3, column 3, and row 4, columns 2, 3 and 4. Those are exactly the colours and positions in the stored answer.":"Faɗaɗa hoton da ke tsakiya zai bar launi kore a saman dama da kuma a layin 2, shafi na 3; launi ja a layin 2, shafi na 1; sannan launi ruwan kasa (brown) a layin 2, shafi na 2; layin 3, shafi na 3; da kuma layin 4, shafuka na 2, 3, da 4. Waɗannan su ne ainihin launuka da matsayin da ke cikin amsar da aka adana.","Choose language":"Zaɓi harshe","Search languages":"Nemi harsuna","Close language selector":"Rufe zaɓin harshe","No languages found":"Ba a sami harsuna ba","Free IQ test for fun | IQ Champion":"Gwajin IQ kyauta don nishaɗi | IQ Champion","A free IQ-style test for fun: 36 visual puzzles, 40 minutes, saved progress and an estimated IQ result. No account needed.":"Gwaji irin na IQ kyauta don nishaɗi: ya ƙunshi wasanin gwada hankali na gani guda 36, ​​a cikin mintuna 40. Za a adana ci gaban da aka samu, tare da kimanta sakamakon IQ ɗin ku. Ba a buƙatar buɗe asusu.","Choose your preferred language. Your answers and original deadline stay saved.":"Zaɓi harshen da kake so. Amsoshin da ka bayar da kuma lokacin da aka ware tun farko za su kasance a adane.","Loading language…":"Ana ɗora harshe…","The language could not be loaded. Your test and answers are unchanged.":"Ba a sami damar ɗora harshen ba. Gwajin ku da amsoshin da kuka bayar ba su canza ba.","Feedback is available in Danish and English.":"Akwai sharhi ko bayani a harshen Danish da Ingilishi.","Shared achievement":"Nasarar da aka raba","Shared result":"Sakamakon da aka raba","Shared results are self-reported.":"Sakamakon da aka raba ya dogara ne kan bayanan da mutum ya bayar da kansa.","Shared achievements are self-reported. No age, country, answers or personal profiles are shared.":"Nasarorin da aka raba sun dogara ne kan bayanan da mutum ya bayar da kansa. Ba a bayyana shekaru, ƙasa, amsoshi, ko bayanan sirri na mutum ba.","Try the 36 puzzles yourself":"Gwada warware wasanin gwada hankali guda 36 da kanka","Try the test yourself":"Gwada yin jarabawar da kanka","A visual challenge in IQ Champion. Can you spot the pattern too?":"Kalubalen gani a cikin IQ Champion. Shin za ka iya gane tsarin da aka bi?","A free visual puzzle test, just for fun. Not a professionally validated IQ measurement.":"Jarabawar wasanin gwada hankali ta gani, wadda ake yi don nishaɗi kawai. Ba ainihin ma'aunin IQ ba ne da ƙwararru suka tabbatar da ingancinsa.","Page not found":"Ba a sami shafin ba","You can continue in another language.":"Za ka iya ci gaba ta amfani da wani harshen daban.","answered":"an amsa","unanswered":"ba a amsa ba","correct":"daidai","incorrect":"ba daidai ba","IQ Champion":"IQ Champion","IQCHAMPION":"IQCHAMPION","English":"English","Dansk":"Dansk","Privacy":"Keɓantawa"},"templates":{"Estimated median range: {0} ({1} timed correct answers).":"Kimanin matsakaicin mataki: {0} (amsoshi {1} da aka bayar daidai a cikin lokaci).","Question {0} · {1}":"Tambaya {0} · {1}","{0} correct patterns":"Tsari {0} da aka gane daidai","Active time: {0}":"Lokacin aiki: {0}","Comparison: {0} voluntary attempts over {1} days.":"Kwatankwazo: ƙoƙari {0} da aka yi bisa zaɓin kai a cikin kwanaki {1}.","Question {0} / {1}":"Tambaya {0} / {1}","Review question {0} / {1}":"Duba tambaya {0} / {1}","Row {0}, icon {1}":"Layi {0}, alama {1}","Answer {0}":"Amsa {0}","Question {0}, {1}":"Tambaya {0}, {1}","Review question {0}, {1}":"Duba tambaya {0}, {1}","{0} correct; {1} incorrect; {2} unanswered.":"{0} daidai; {1} ba daidai ba; {2} ba a amsa ba.","{0} answered; {1} unanswered.":"{0} an amsa; {1} ba a amsa ba.","{0} answered; {1} unanswered. Unanswered questions count as incorrect. Once finished, you cannot change answers.":"{0} an amsa; {1} ba a amsa ba. Tambayoyin da ba a amsa ba ana ɗaukar su a matsayin kuskure. Da zarar an gama, ba za a iya canza amsoshin ba.","{0} / {1} correct":"{0} / {1} daidai","Percentile among historical participants: {0}":"Matsayi (percentile) idan aka kwatanta da mahalarta na baya: {0}","Participants scoring lower: {0}%. Participants with the same score: {1}%.":"Mahalarta da suka sami maki ƙasa da haka: {0}%. Mahalarta da suka sami maki iri ɗaya: {1}%.","Reference group: {0} historical attempts. Attempts with recorded durations over one minute and up to 40 minutes are included. Tied scores share the midpoint of their percentile group. Estimates are rounded to whole numbers and displayed only within 55–145, with a limit indicator outside that range. This is a scale conversion, not an independently validated population IQ measurement. Practice and repeated attempts can affect your result. Some example images have been corrected since the historical attempts were collected, which limits comparability.":"Rukunin kwatance: {0} gwaje-gwajen da aka yi a baya. An haɗa gwaje-gwajen da lokacin da aka ɗauka ya wuce minti ɗaya har zuwa minti 40. Wadanda suka sami maki iri ɗaya suna raba matsakaicin matsayinsu (percentile). An zagaya lambobin zuwa cikakkun lambobi, kuma ana nuna su ne kawai tsakanin 55 da 145; idan ya wuce wannan iyaka, za a nuna alamar iyaka. Wannan canjin ma'auni ne, ba ainihin auna IQ na jama'a da aka tabbatar ta hanyar bincike mai zaman kansa ba. Yin atisaye da maimaita gwajin na iya shafar sakamakonku. Wasu hotunan misali an gyara su tun lokacin da aka tattara bayanan baya, wanda hakan ke rage damar kwatanta sakamakon.","My estimated IQ in IQ Champion: {0}. Just for fun. Try it: {1}":"Kiyasin IQ dina a cikin IQ Champion: {0}. Don nishaɗi kawai. Gwada shi: {1}","I solved question {0} correctly in {1}. Can you do it too? {2}":"Na amsa tambaya {0} daidai a cikin {1}. Shin za ku iya yin hakan ma? {2}","I solved question {0} correctly in {1} (estimated median among correct answers: {2}). Can you do it too? {3}":"Na amsa tambaya {0} daidai a cikin {1} (kiyasin matsakaicin lokaci tsakanin amsoshin da suka yi daidai: {2}). Shin za ku iya yin hakan ma? {3}","I found {0} correct patterns in IQ Champion. Try it: {1}":"Na gano tsari (patterns) {0} daidai a cikin IQ Champion. Gwada shi: {1}","Can you find the missing patterns in IQ Champion? {0}":"Shin za ku iya gano tsare-tsaren da suka ɓace a cikin IQ Champion? {0}","Question {0} solved":"An amsa tambaya {0}","{0} patterns solved":"An warware tsare-tsare {0}","{0} / 36 correct. {1}":"{0} / 36 daidai. {1}","Estimated IQ {0} | IQ Champion":"Ƙiyasin IQ {0} | IQ Champion"},"status":"translated"};
